<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>카페 등록</title></head>
<body>
  <h1>카페 등록</h1>
  <form method="post" action="/menus">
    <label>ID <input type="number" name="id" min="1" required></label>
    <label>메뉴명 <input name="name" maxlength="100" required></label>
    <label>가격 <input type="number" name="price" min="0" required></label>
    <label>카테고리 <input name="category" maxlength="100" required></label>
    <button type="submit">수정</button>
  </form>
  <form method="post" action="/menus/delete">
    <label>ID <input type="number" name="id" min="1" required></label>
    <button type="submit">삭제</button>
  </form>
  <%- include("partials/sample_table", { menus }) %>
  <p>폼 또는 주소를 통해 요청하고 조회 결과를 확인하세요.</p>
</body>
</html>
